  "name": "MathlibAnnex.Analysis.CStarAlgebra.NonUnitalCStarRepresentation",
  "natural_language_statement": "Let A be a complex C*-algebra, not assumed unital, and H a complex Hilbert space. A representation of A on H is a complex-linear nonunital star-algebra homomorphism into the bounded complex-linear operators on H. It preserves addition, multiplication, complex scalar multiplication and involution; neither preservation of a unit nor faithfulness is built in.",
  "one_sentence_role": "Names nonunital complex star-algebra homomorphisms into bounded operators as the representation type.",
